# Markdown is governed by markdownlint-cli2 (`npm run lint:md`), not Prettier:
# Prettier rewrites tables and list markers, which fights markdownlint.
**/*.md

# Prettier owns formatting everywhere: `xo` runs with `prettier: true` in both app
# workspaces, so its @stylistic rules are off and the two tools accept the same output.

# Regenerated by tooling, so formatting them only creates churn on the next run
**/drizzle/meta/
.pi/settings.json
**/grading.json
**/eval_metadata.json

# pi / Claude skill trees are not Prettier's territory (skill assets, evals, harness output)
.pi/
.claude/
